        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-296 (ensure controlled execution — Recruitment &amp; Onboarding (PA-19.1).) | - operational: upfront position review and transparency; operational: benefits comparison during transfer review; operational: structured handover plan with documentation requirement
Owner: HR Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
